### ============================================================================
### 1. SYSTEM & HEALTH CHECK
### ============================================================================

### 1.1 Health Check (Verify API Gateway & DB status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Content-Type: application/json

### ============================================================================
### 2. AUTHENTICATION & REGISTRATION MODULE
### ============================================================================

### 2.1 Send OTP (Registration Step 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/send-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mobile": "9876543210",
  "countryCode": "+91",
  "purpose": "REGISTER",
  "name": "naman",
  "profileFor": "Myself",
  "step": 1
}

### 2.1.1 Verify OTP (Registration Step 2 - Returns Bearer Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9509531768",
  "otp": "1234",
  "purpose": "REGISTER",
  "countryCode": "+91",
  "token": "8872c21b6e396ea7ee6b82c8",
  "step": 2
}

### 2.1.2 Save Registration Step (Step 3 - Basic Details)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register-step
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "phone": "9509531768",
  "step": 3,
  "gender": "MALE",
  "day": "15",
  "month": "Jun",
  "year": "1997",
  "dob": "1997-06-15",
  "motherTongue": "Sindhi",
  "email": "naman@example.com",
  "password": "Password123@"
}

### 2.2 Complete Registration (Phone + OTP + Password + Profile Initialization)
### Note: In development mode (NODE_ENV=development), Master OTP "1234" is always accepted!
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "otp": "8989",
  "password": "Password123@",
  "name": "Testing User",
  "gender": "MALE",
  "profileFor": "MYSELF",
  "countryCode": "+91",
  "clientPlatform": "WEB",
  "subcaste": "Bhaiband",
  "dob": "1997-06-15",
  "maritalStatus": "NEVER_MARRIED",
  "height": 178,
  "education": "B.Tech Computer Science",
  "profession": "Software Engineer",
  "annualIncome": 1800000,
  "city": "Ajmer",
  "state": "Rajasthan",
  "nativePlace": "Ajmer"
}

### 2.3 Candidate Login (Mobile Number + Password)
### Returns ultra-fast lightweight payload: JWT tokens (token + refreshToken) and user context (id, phone, role, status, activeProfileId).
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "password": "Password123@"
}

### 2.3.1 Candidate Login with Mobile Alias & Formatted Phone Number (+91)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "+91 9876543210",
  "password": "Password123@",
  "fcmToken": "c_sample_firebase_device_token_xyz123",
  "clientPlatform": "WEB"
}

### 2.4 Forgot Password (Send OTP to Registered Mobile Number - No Premature Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "countryCode": "+91"
}

### 2.4.1 Verify Password Reset OTP (Issues short-lived single-use resetToken)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "otp": "1234",
  "purpose": "RESET_PASSWORD",
  "countryCode": "+91"
}

### 2.5 Reset Password (Set New Password with verified single-use resetToken)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "newPassword": "NewSecretPassword123@",
  "countryCode": "+91",
  "token": "REPLACE_WITH_RESET_TOKEN_FROM_VERIFY_OTP_RESPONSE"
}

### 2.5.1 Combined 1-Step Reset Password (Alternative direct OTP verification)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/reset-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "otp": "1234",
  "newPassword": "NewSecretPassword123@",
  "countryCode": "+91"
}

### 2.6 Resend Registration OTP
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9829012345",
  "countryCode": "+91",
  "purpose": "REGISTER"
}

### 2.7 Instant Phone Number Check (For typing check on register screen)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/check-phone
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "9876543210",
  "countryCode": "+91"
}

### 2.7.2 Complete Registration (Finalize Onboarding & Update Status to COMPLETE)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/complete-registration
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 2.7.3 Refresh Token (Silent JWT Renewal using Refresh Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/refresh-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refreshToken}}"
}

### 2.8 Logout (Blacklists JWT Token in Redis)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ============================================================================
### 3. MULTI-PROFILE & FAMILY DELEGATION ARCHITECTURE
### ============================================================================

### 3.1 List All Candidate Profiles Managed by this Account
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/my-profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.2 Create Secondary Profile (e.g. Sibling or Child under same parent phone)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/profiles
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Simran Advani",
  "profileFor": "DAUGHTER",
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "subcaste": "Bhaiband",
  "dob": "1999-09-20",
  "maritalStatus": "NEVER_MARRIED",
  "height": 165,
  "education": "MBA Finance",
  "profession": "Financial Analyst",
  "annualIncome": 1200000,
  "city": "Mumbai",
  "state": "Maharashtra"
}

### 3.3 Switch Active Profile Context (Returns fresh JWT with updated profileId)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/switch-profile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "targetProfileId": "{{profileId}}"
}

### 3.4 Update Profile Status (ACTIVE / HIDDEN / DEACTIVATED)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/auth/users/profiles/{{profileId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "HIDDEN"
}

### 3.5 Grant Family Delegation Access (Allow relative/parent to co-manage profile)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/users/profiles/{{profileId}}/grants
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "granteePhone": "9829099999",
  "accessRole": "CO_MANAGER",
  "relationshipToCandidate": "PARENT"
}

### 3.6 List Active Profile Delegation Grants
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/users/profiles/{{profileId}}/grants
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.7 Revoke Family Delegation Grant
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/auth/users/profiles/{{profileId}}/grants/{{grantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 3.8 Transfer Profile Ownership to Candidate's Own Account
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/users/profiles/{{profileId}}/transfer
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "candidatePhone": "9829099999",
  "otp": "1234"
}

### ============================================================================
### 4. CANDIDATE PROFILE MANAGEMENT MODULE
### ============================================================================

### 4.1 Get Profile (Single Unified API)
### Case A: Khud Ka Data dekhna (Empty body `{}` - bina id ke)
POST {{baseUrl}}/profile/getProfile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Case B: Dusre Candidate Ki Profile dekhna (Payload me `"id"` bhej kar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/profile/getProfile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "{{profileId}}"
}

### ============================================================================
### 4.2 Edit Profile (Single Unified API)
### Ek hi API call me profile ke sabhi/kisi bhi details update karne ke liye:
### Basic details, Education, Profession, Location, Family, Partner Preferences
### ============================================================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/profile/editProfile
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Simran Vaswani",
  "aboutMe": "Sindhi professional looking for an educated and caring life partner.",
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "dateOfBirth": 866332800000,
  "height": 165,
  "maritalStatus": "NEVER_MARRIED",
  "subcaste": "Bhaiband",
  "gotra": "Vaswani",
  "motherGotra": "Advani",
  "manglik": "NON_MANGLIK",
  "education": {
    "degree": "MBA",
    "field": "Marketing",
    "college": "IIM Ahmedabad"
  },
  "profession": {
    "occupation": "Senior Product Manager",
    "companyName": "Tech Corp",
    "annualIncome": 2100000,
    "currency": "INR"
  },
  "location": {
    "city": "Mumbai",
    "state": "Maharashtra",
    "country": "India",
    "nativePlace": "Ajmer"
  },
  "family": {
    "familyType": "NUCLEAR",
    "fatherOccupation": "Businessman",
    "motherOccupation": "Homemaker"
  },
  "partnerPreference": {
    "ageRange": { "min": 26, "max": 32 },
    "heightRange": { "min": 160, "max": 185 },
    "maritalStatus": ["NEVER_MARRIED"],
    "subcastes": ["Bhaiband", "Amil", "Sahiti"],
    "manglik": "NON_MANGLIK",
    "education": "Graduate & Above",
    "occupation": "Professional"
  }
}

