### 18.1.2 Staff Bulk Upload All 100 Members directly from JSON File
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/members/bulk
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

< ./sample_100_members.json

### 18.2 Error Scenario: Candidate Registration Under 18 Years (Expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/members
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Underage Candidate",
  "gender": "FEMALE",
  "phone": "9820011122",
  "age": 16,
  "dateOfBirth": "2010-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"
}

### 18.3 Staff Editing Member Biodata (Success 200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/members/SM10001
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profession": {
    "occupation": "Senior Vice President",
    "annualIncome": 4500000
  },
  "aboutMe": "Promoted to Senior VP. Dedicated to family, cultural values, and philanthropic initiatives.",
  "membershipTier": "DIAMOND",
  "isVerified": true
}

### 18.4 Error Scenario: Edit Non-Existent Member ID (Expect 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/members/SM_NON_EXISTENT_999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Non Existent Member"
}

### ============================================================================
### 19. MATCH RESPONSES & PROPOSAL CLEARINGHOUSE (`/matchmaking/responses`)
### ============================================================================

### 19.1 Get Match Responses Clearinghouse Directory
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/matchmaking/responses?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 19.2 Filter Match Responses by Stage (MEETING_FIXED)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/matchmaking/responses?stage=MEETING_FIXED
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 19.3 Staff Recording Candidate Phone Consent
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/matchmaking/record-response
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "proposalId": "MR_702",
  "candidateId": "SM10004",
  "response": "ACCEPTED",
  "feedbackReason": "Profiles match well. Excited for parental tele-conference.",
  "phoneNotes": "Spoke with Ananya and her mother. Agreed to proceed with joint call."
}

### 19.4 Staff Recording Candidate Phone Consent (Declined Alliance)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/matchmaking/record-response
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "proposalId": "MR_702",
  "candidateId": "SM10004",
  "response": "DECLINED",
  "feedbackReason": "Relocation preference does not match expectations."
}

### 19.5 Error Scenario: Record Response for Unrelated Candidate (Expect 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/matchmaking/record-response
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "proposalId": "MR_701",
  "candidateId": "SM99999",
  "response": "ACCEPTED"
}

### 19.6 Advance Proposal Stage to Meeting Fixed
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/matchmaking/responses/MR_703/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stage": "MEETING_FIXED",
  "meetingDetails": {
    "date": "2026-11-05",
    "time": "05:00 PM",
    "venue": "ITC Rajputana, Jaipur",
    "attendees": "Both Families & RM Simran Khatri",
    "agenda": "Formal Kachhi Misri and horoscope agreement"
  },
  "notes": "Both parents finalized date and venue over conference call."
}

### 19.7 Error Scenario: Advance Stage for Non-Existent Proposal (Expect 404)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/matchmaking/responses/MR_NON_EXISTENT/status
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "stage": "DROPPED",
  "dropReason": "Test drop"
}

### ============================================================================
### 20. MASTER SETTINGS & GLOBAL TOGGLES MODULE (`/master-settings`)
### ============================================================================

### 20.1 Get Global Master Settings & Platform Toggles
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/master-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 20.2 Update Global Platform Toggles (SMS, Razorpay, Maintenance)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/master-settings
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "maintenanceMode": {
    "enabled": false,
    "message": "Routine database maintenance complete. Systems fully operational."
  },
  "smsGateway": {
    "enabled": true,
    "provider": "FAST2SMS",
    "dltApproved": true,
    "rateLimitPerMinute": 5
  },
  "paymentGateway": {
    "enabled": true,
    "provider": "RAZORPAY",
    "sandboxMode": false
  },
  "features": {
    "horoscopeGunaMilan": true,
    "inAppChat": true,
    "biodataPdfDownload": true
  }
}

### ============================================================================
### 21. ADMIN TOOLS & DIAGNOSTICS (`/tools`)
### ============================================================================

### 21.1 Telemetry Health Check (MongoDB, Redis & Socket status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/tools/health
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 21.2 Flush Redis Memory Cache (All Keys)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/tools/cache/clear
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scope": "ALL"
}

### 21.3 Flush Redis Memory Cache (Scoped to PROFILES)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/tools/cache/clear
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "scope": "PROFILES"
}

### 21.4 Rebuild Search & Database Collection Indexes
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/tools/reindex
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 21.5 Trigger Encrypted Database Backup Dump
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/tools/export-backup?format=encrypted&encrypt=true
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

