### 22. REVIEWS & TESTIMONIALS MODERATION MODULE (`/reviews` & `/admin/reviews`)
### ============================================================================

### 22.1 Get Public Approved Reviews
GET {{baseUrl}}/reviews/public-list
Content-Type: application/json

### 22.2 Submit Member Review & Rating
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "title": "Found my ideal life partner through Sindhi Matrimony!",
  "review": "Wonderful experience, genuine verified profiles and supportive matchmaking team.",
  "relationship": "SELF",
  "partnerName": "Simran Vazirani",
  "weddingDate": "2026-02-15"
}

### 22.3 Get Admin Reviews List (Moderation Queue)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/reviews?page=1&limit=10&status=ALL
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

### 22.4 Moderate Review Status (Approve/Reject)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/reviews/rev_004/moderation
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "APPROVED",
  "moderationNote": "Verified story and wedding confirmation."
}

### 22.5 Update Review Content (Admin Edit)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/admin/reviews/rev_004
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "rating": 5,
  "title": "Exceptional Service & Genuine Community",
  "review": "Truly authentic community platform for Sindhi families across India and UAE."
}

### 22.6 Delete Review (Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/admin/reviews/rev_004
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

